## [Boolean](`NeoFaker.Boolean`)

{: .col-1}

### [`boolean(true_ratio \\ 50, opts \\ [])`](`NeoFaker.Boolean.boolean/2`)

```elixir
iex> NeoFaker.Boolean.boolean()
false

iex> NeoFaker.Boolean.boolean(75)
true

iex> NeoFaker.Boolean.boolean(75, integer: true)
