```

### [`mac_address(opts \\ [])`](`NeoFaker.Internet.mac_address/1`)

```elixir
iex> NeoFaker.Internet.mac_address()
"74:4E:44:B0:D0:93"

iex> NeoFaker.Internet.mac_address(uppercase: false)
"74:4e:44:b0:d0:93"

iex> NeoFaker.Internet.mac_address(separator: "-")
